#: src/components/forms/ProductForm/index.tsx:317
msgid "<0>This is the total quantity available across every date in your schedule combined — not a per-date limit. To limit attendance for each date, set a capacity on the <1>Occurrence Schedule page</1>.</0>"
msgstr "<0>這是整個日程所有場次合計的可售總數量，而不是每場的限制。如需限制每場的人數，請在<1>場次安排頁面</1>設定容量。</0>"

#: src/components/common/OrganizerWebhookTable/index.tsx:205
